[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3268250974","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110332#issuecomment-3268250974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110332","id":3268250974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7CzY1e","user":{"login":"bitwes","id":1156520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTY1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1156520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes","html_url":"https://github.com/bitwes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitwes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-08T22:35:48Z","updated_at":"2025-09-08T22:35:48Z","body":"The following is called from the signal handler for `EditorInterface.get_script_editor().editor_script_changed`.  This shows how I'm deciding when things have gone awry.\n```gdscript\nvar _scripts_that_have_been_warned_about = []\nfunc is_test_script(script):\n\tvar from = script.get_base_script()\n\tif(from == null and script.get_script_method_list().size() == 0):\n\t\tif(OS.is_stdout_verbose() or !_scripts_that_have_been_warned_about.has(script.resource_path)):\n\t\t\tpush_warning(str('[GUT] Treating ', script.resource_path, \" as test script:  \", \n\t\t\t\t\"GUT was not able to retrieve information about this script.  This may \", \n\t\t\t\t\"have to do with having VSCode open.  Restarting Godot sometimes helps.  See \",\n\t\t\t\t\"https://github.com/bitwes/Gut/issues/754\"))\n\t\t\t_scripts_that_have_been_warned_about.append(script.resource_path)\n\t\t# We can't know if this is a test script.  It's more usable if we\n\t\t# assume this is a test script.\n\t\treturn true\n\telse:\n\t\twhile(from and from.resource_path != 'res://addons/gut/test.gd'):\n\t\t\tfrom = from.get_base_script()\n\t\treturn from != null\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3268250974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315937095","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110332#issuecomment-3315937095","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110332","id":3315937095,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FpS9H","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T11:34:56Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T11:34:56Z","body":"This sounds like a shallow loaded script is leaked. Might be worth testing whether https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109345 has an influence on it. But there might very well be another leak somewhere in the language server.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315937095/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3330864898","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110332#issuecomment-3330864898","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110332","id":3330864898,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GiPcC","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T22:07:04Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T22:07:04Z","body":"Can reproduce with v4.5.stable.official [876b29033] \n\nNote for testing:\n- `test_test.gd` must not be open when starting the editor. It has to be opened manually at a later point.\n- The restarting part is unnecessary, it's enough to start Godot, then open VSCode and after VSCode is connected open the `test_test.gd`.\n\nCan't reproduce when applying https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109345 <sub>(after adding another fix, to prevent scripts from depending on themself, which would trigger even more leaks. At this point I'm close to just closing this PR. Coupling the scrip editor with the resource caching system has created an absolutely untouchable mess.)</sub>","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3330864898/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]